{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — My Account › Overview (profile dashboard)
   templates/user/profile.html.twig

   REBUILT from the user's live template onto the shared account
   shell — same recipe as help / notifications / bookings /
   payments / messages / reviews / wallet / wishlist. This page
   and payments share the same PENDING-PAYMENT NOTICE above the
   shell (same .up-notice classes), and like payments it has NO
   ub-page-head — so the layout fix follows the payments variant.

     - Sidebar: shared partial templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig,
       highlight key 'overview'. The inline <aside> + its ~190-line
       CSS block + the 13-entry sideLinks array (which still
       carried the REMOVED Saved Searches entry) are gone — the
       partial owns them (12 entries, help is the last).
     - Navbar include: defensive ?? guards added — controller
       variable names kept (is_host / nav_avatar /
       notification_count). current_page: 'profile'.
     - Footer: shared partials/footer.html.twig after </main>
       (the live page already had it — kept).
     - Lucide: the live page already used the guarded loader
       (window.__rhNavbarLucide — never double-loads with the
       navbar's) — kept verbatim.
     - Reveal: the KILL-SWITCH CSS (force every .up-reveal visible)
       and the old add-classes-immediately failsafe script are
       dropped -> the REAL legacy mechanism (.up-reveal waits for
       .in-view) + the 1.5s failsafe so the page can never render
       blank. Markup untouched — the 9 reveal cards carry no
       --i stagger (they didn't before either).
     - Collapse: same localStorage key (roomhive_sidebar_collapsed)
       + the updateTitles version (already on the live page — kept).

   NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof (payments
   variant — the notice sits above the shell, there is NO
   ub-page-head):
     - .up-notice-wrap carries the navbar clearance as PADDING
       (max-width: 1560px, padding: 110px 20px 0 — padding can
       never collapse; the old margin: 18px auto -6px had zero
       clearance and rode under the fixed navbar).
     - main.up-dashboard { margin-top: 0; padding: 22px 20px 70px;
       max-width: 1560px; } — the shell follows the notice at its
       original rhythm, at full available width (specificity
       0,1,1 — always wins vs myaccount.css).
     - .up-dashboard .up-content { gap: 20px; } — rhythm insurance
       on a bumped selector.
     - .up-dashboard .up-sidebar { top: 110px; } — the sticky
       offset matches the other account pages (the partial's
       default is 86px).
     - Dropped page-local blocks myaccount.css owns: .up-dashboard
       flex def, .up-content base, .up-card base. .up-card-head
       (+ its a rules) stays page-local (payments precedent).
     - box-sizing group extended to .up-notice-wrap (border-box so
       its 20px side padding stays inside 1560px).

   Content (1:1 with the live page — nothing content-side changed):
   - pending-payment notice (up-notice-warn / up-notice-ok)
   - profile card: avatar picker (POST /profile/avatar, syncs the
     navbar avatar too), Verified / Pending / Not-verified badge,
     member meta list, Edit Profile -> /profile/edit, About Me
   - 4 chart cards: Bookings + Total Spent bars (last 6 months,
     server-computed heights), Wallet donut (data-pct, offset
     125.66), Wishlist stack + legend (wl_categories)
   - Recent Bookings (status + pay chips) | right column: Identity
     Verification, Payment Summary (This week / To pay tabs swap
     from data-* attributes), Payment Methods, Account Security,
     Need Help
   - Wishlist grid: heart remove -> POST /wishlist/remove
     (capture-phase delegation), count + empty-state swap

   Data from ProfileController::index (user, is_host, nav_avatar,
   notification_count, id_status, summary, chart, wallet,
   wl_total, wl_categories, bookings, wishlist).
   Controller untouched — template-only change. Pure Twig -> Ctrl+F5.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>My Account · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
            }

            body {
                background: #f3f5f9;
            }

            .up-notice-wrap,
            .up-dashboard,
            .up-dashboard * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            svg.lucide {
                vertical-align: -0.18em;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                           NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                           (payments variant: the pending-payment notice sits
                           above the shell, there is NO ub-page-head). The notice
                           wrap carries the clearance as PADDING — margins can
                           collapse, padding can never — so the notice cannot
                           ride under the fixed navbar (the old margin:
                           18px auto -6px had zero clearance). The shell follows
                           right below at full available width.
                        ========================================================== */
            .up-notice-wrap {
                max-width: 1560px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 110px 20px 0;
            }

            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 22px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            /* keep the shell's vertical rhythm between the stacked
                           sections (myaccount.css owns the rest) */
            .up-dashboard .up-content {
                gap: 20px;
            }

            /* sticky offset matches the other account pages — when you
                           scroll, the sidebar sticks at the 110px line instead of
                           tucking under the navbar (the partial's default is 86px) */
            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            /* ================= notice ================= */
            .up-notice {
                display: flex;
                gap: 12px;
                align-items: flex-start;
                padding: 14px 18px;
                border-radius: 14px;
                font-size: 14.5px;
            }
            .up-notice svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                margin-top: 1px;
            }
            .up-notice p {
                margin: 0;
            }
            .up-notice-ok {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
                border: 1px solid #bfe8d2;
            }
            .up-notice-warn {
                background: #fff6e6;
                color: #8a5a00;
                border: 1px solid #f3ddb0;
            }

            /* ================= profile card ================= */
            .up-profile-card {
                background: var(--rh-card);
                border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
                padding: 24px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.05);
            }
            .up-pc-head {
                display: flex;
                gap: 20px;
                align-items: flex-start;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .up-photo-picker {
                position: relative;
                width: 96px;
                height: 96px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                cursor: pointer;
                display: block;
            }
            .up-photo-picker img {
                width: 96px;
                height: 96px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                object-fit: cover;
                display: block;
                border: 3px solid #fff;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.15);
            }
            .up-photo-fallback {
                width: 96px;
                height: 96px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2b3b4d, #1c2a38);
                color: #fff;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                border: 3px solid #fff;
                box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.15);
            }
            .up-photo-fallback svg {
                width: 44px;
                height: 44px;
            }
            .up-photo-badge {
                position: absolute;
                right: -2px;
                bottom: 2px;
                width: 30px;
                height: 30px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                background: #fff;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.25);
                transition: transform 0.2s ease;
            }
            .up-photo-badge svg {
                width: 15px;
                height: 15px;
            }
            .up-photo-picker:hover .up-photo-badge {
                transform: rotate(-12deg) scale(1.08);
            }

            .up-pc-id {
                flex: 1 1 260px;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .up-pc-name-row {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
            }
            .up-pc-name-row h1 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 26px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-pc-sub {
                margin: 4px 0 12px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            .up-meta {
                list-style: none;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 8px;
            }
            .up-meta li {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 10px;
                color: #43566a;
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            .up-meta svg {
                width: 16px;
                height: 16px;
                color: #8a9bab;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-pc-actions {
                margin-left: auto;
            }
            .up-btn-dark {
                display: inline-block;
                background: var(--rh-ink);
                color: #fff;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 600;
                padding: 11px 20px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                transition:
                    opacity 0.2s ease,
                    transform 0.2s ease;
            }
            .up-btn-dark:hover {
                opacity: 0.9;
                transform: translateY(-1px);
            }
            .up-about {
                margin-top: 20px;
                padding-top: 18px;
                border-top: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
            }
            .up-about h3 {
                margin: 0 0 6px;
                font-size: 15px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-about p {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.6;
                max-width: 70ch;
            }

            .up-badge-id {
                display: inline-flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
                padding: 5px 11px;
                border-radius: 999px;
            }
            .up-badge-id svg {
                width: 14px;
                height: 14px;
            }
            .up-badge-id-ok {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
            }
            .up-badge-id-wait {
                background: #fff6e6;
                color: #8a5a00;
            }
            .up-badge-id-none {
                background: #eef1f5;
                color: #5b6b7c;
            }

            /* ================= chart row ================= */
            .up-ch-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
                gap: 18px;
            }
            .up-ch-card {
                background: var(--rh-card);
                border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
                padding: 18px;
                min-width: 0;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.05);
            }
            .up-ch-card header {
                display: flex;
                align-items: baseline;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 8px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }
            .up-ch-card h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 15px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-ch-sub {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            .up-ch-bars {
                display: flex;
                align-items: stretch;
                gap: 8px;
                height: 120px;
            }
            .up-ch-col {
                flex: 1 1 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .up-ch-barzone {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                display: flex;
                align-items: flex-end;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .up-ch-bar {
                width: 70%;
                max-width: 26px;
                border-radius: 6px 6px 2px 2px;
            }
            .up-ch-bar-bk {
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2f7de1, #1c2a38);
            }
            .up-ch-bar-sp {
                background: linear-gradient(180deg, #eda423, #d98c12);
            }
            .up-ch-lab {
                text-align: center;
                font-size: 11px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                padding-top: 6px;
            }

            .up-ch-donut-wrap {
                position: relative;
                width: 132px;
                margin: 6px auto 14px;
            }
            .up-ch-donut {
                display: block;
                width: 132px;
                height: 132px;
                transform: rotate(-90deg);
            }
            .up-ch-donut circle {
                fill: none;
                stroke-width: 6;
            }
            .donut-bg {
                stroke: #edf1f6;
            }
            .donut-fg {
                stroke: var(--rh-accent);
                stroke-linecap: round;
                stroke-dasharray: 125.66;
                stroke-dashoffset: 125.66;
                transition: stroke-dashoffset 0.8s ease;
            }
            .up-ch-donut-center {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: center;
            }
            .up-ch-donut-center strong {
                font-size: 17px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-ch-donut-center span {
                font-size: 11px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-ch-donut-legend {
                margin: 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 6px;
            }
            .up-ch-donut-legend div {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                font-size: 13px;
            }
            .up-ch-donut-legend dt {
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-ch-donut-legend dd {
                margin: 0;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }

            .up-ch-stack {
                display: flex;
                height: 16px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                overflow: hidden;
                background: #edf1f6;
                margin-bottom: 12px;
            }
            .up-ch-legend {
                list-style: none;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 7px;
            }
            .up-ch-legend li {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 8px;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #43566a;
            }
            .up-ch-legend li b {
                margin-left: auto;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-ch-legend .dot {
                width: 10px;
                height: 10px;
                border-radius: 3px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-ch-legend .muted {
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }

            /* ================= two columns ================= */
            .up-two-col {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr;
                gap: 18px;
                align-items: start;
            }
            .up-col {
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 18px;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            /* .up-card base def lives in myaccount.css — same as payments/reviews */
            .up-card-head {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: space-between;
                gap: 10px;
                margin-bottom: 14px;
            }
            .up-card-head h3 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 16px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-card-head a {
                font-size: 13px;
                color: #2f7de1;
                text-decoration: none;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            .up-card-head a:hover {
                text-decoration: underline;
            }
            .up-card-txt {
                margin: 0;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 1.6;
            }

            .up-booking {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 14px;
                padding: 12px 0;
                border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
            }
            .up-booking:last-child {
                border-bottom: 0;
            }
            .up-booking-photo {
                position: relative;
                width: 74px;
                height: 56px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                overflow: hidden;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6ee, #c9d4e0);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                color: #93a5b7;
            }
            .up-booking-photo img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
            }
            .up-booking-photo svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
            }
            .up-booking-info {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            .up-booking-info h4 {
                margin: 0 0 3px;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }
            .up-booking-dates {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 6px;
                margin: 0 0 6px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-booking-dates svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-status {
                display: inline-block;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                font-weight: 700;
                padding: 3px 9px;
                border-radius: 999px;
                text-transform: capitalize;
            }
            .up-status-pending {
                background: #fff6e6;
                color: #8a5a00;
            }
            .up-status-confirmed,
            .up-status-completed {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
            }
            .up-status-cancelled {
                background: #fdecec;
                color: #a33a3a;
            }
            .up-status-other {
                background: #eef1f5;
                color: #5b6b7c;
            }
            .up-booking-pay {
                text-align: right;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-booking-pay strong {
                display: block;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-paychip {
                display: inline-block;
                margin-top: 4px;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 700;
                padding: 3px 8px;
                border-radius: 999px;
            }
            .up-pay-full {
                background: #e8f7ef;
                color: #14683e;
            }
            .up-pay-advance {
                background: #e9f2fd;
                color: #1d5fb8;
            }
            .up-pay-none {
                background: #fdecec;
                color: #a33a3a;
            }
            .up-empty {
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                font-size: 14px;
                margin: 6px 0;
            }
            .up-empty a {
                color: #2f7de1;
            }

            .up-sum-tabs {
                display: inline-flex;
                background: #eef1f5;
                border-radius: 10px;
                padding: 3px;
            }
            .up-sum-tab {
                border: 0;
                background: transparent;
                font: inherit;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                font-weight: 600;
                color: #5b6b7c;
                padding: 6px 12px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            .up-sum-tab.active {
                background: #fff;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.12);
            }
            .up-sum-value {
                font-size: 30px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            }
            .up-sum-cap {
                margin: 2px 0 14px;
                font-size: 13px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-sum-row {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                font-size: 14px;
                padding: 9px 0;
                border-top: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                color: #43566a;
            }
            .up-sum-row b {
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }

            .up-pay-method {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 12px;
            }
            .up-pay-method svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
                color: #2f7de1;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-pay-method strong {
                display: block;
                font-size: 14px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
            }
            .up-pay-method span {
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }

            /* ================= wishlist ================= */
            .up-wl {
                background: var(--rh-card);
                border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: var(--rh-radius);
                padding: 20px;
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.05);
            }
            .up-wl-grid {
                display: grid;
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
                gap: 16px;
            }
            .up-wl-photo {
                position: relative;
                height: 150px;
                border-radius: 12px;
                overflow: hidden;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6ee, #c9d4e0);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                color: #93a5b7;
            }
            .up-wl-photo img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
                transition: transform 0.35s ease;
            }
            .listing-box:hover .up-wl-photo img {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
            .up-wl-photo svg {
                width: 26px;
                height: 26px;
            }
            .up-wl-heart {
                position: absolute;
                top: 10px;
                right: 10px;
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                border-radius: 50%;
                border: 0;
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                cursor: pointer;
                box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(28, 42, 56, 0.22);
                transition: transform 0.2s ease;
                z-index: 2;
            }
            .up-wl-heart svg {
                width: 17px;
                height: 17px;
                color: #e5484d;
                fill: #e5484d;
            }
            .up-wl-heart:hover {
                transform: scale(1.1);
            }
            .up-wl-heart.busy {
                opacity: 0.5;
                pointer-events: none;
            }
            .up-wl-info {
                padding: 10px 4px 2px;
            }
            .up-wl-info h4 {
                margin: 0 0 3px;
                font-size: 14.5px;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }
            .up-wl-loc {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
                margin: 0 0 6px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-wl-loc svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }
            .up-wl-price {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 14px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            .up-wl-price strong {
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                font-size: 15px;
            }
            .up-wl-empty {
                margin-top: 6px;
            }

            /* ================= dark mode =================
                           (sidebar dark rules live in the partial) */
            html.dark body {
                background: #141c26;
            }
            html.dark .up-profile-card,
            html.dark .up-ch-card,
            html.dark .up-card,
            html.dark .up-wl {
                background: #1e2a38;
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
                box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            }
            html.dark .up-pc-name-row h1,
            html.dark .up-ch-card h3,
            html.dark .up-card-head h3,
            html.dark .up-booking-info h4,
            html.dark .up-wl-info h4,
            html.dark .up-about h3,
            html.dark .up-sum-value,
            html.dark .up-ch-donut-center strong,
            html.dark .up-booking-pay strong,
            html.dark .up-sum-row b,
            html.dark .up-wl-price strong,
            html.dark .up-ch-legend li b {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark .up-meta li,
            html.dark .up-booking-dates,
            html.dark .up-card-txt,
            html.dark .up-sum-row,
            html.dark .up-wl-loc,
            html.dark .up-wl-price,
            html.dark .up-ch-legend li,
            html.dark .up-ch-lab {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .up-booking,
            html.dark .up-sum-row,
            html.dark .up-about {
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .donut-bg {
                stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            }
            html.dark .up-ch-stack {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            }
            html.dark .up-sum-tabs {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark .up-sum-tab {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark .up-sum-tab.active {
                background: #2a3949;
                color: #fff;
                box-shadow: none;
            }
            html.dark .up-btn-dark {
                background: #eda423;
                color: #1c2a38;
            }
            html.dark .up-photo-picker img,
            html.dark .up-photo-fallback {
                border-color: #1e2a38;
            }

            /* ================= responsive ================= */
            @media (max-width: 1100px) {
                .up-ch-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 980px) {
                .up-two-col {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 860px) {
                .up-dashboard {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
                .up-wl-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
                }
            }
            @media (max-width: 560px) {
                .up-ch-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
                .up-wl-grid {
                    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                }
                .up-pc-actions {
                    margin-left: 0;
                }
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: nav_avatar ?? null,
            notification_count: notification_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'profile'
        }) }}

        <div class="up-notice-wrap">
            <div class="up-notice {% if summary.pending > 0 %}up-notice-warn{% else %}up-notice-ok{% endif %}">
                <i data-lucide="wallet"></i>
                <p>
                    {% if summary.pending > 0 %}
                        You have <strong>{{ summary.pending_str }}</strong> waiting to be paid
                        across {{ summary.pending_count }} booking{{ summary.pending_count == 1 ? '' : 's' }}.
                    {% else %}
                        You're all settled up — no pending payments on your bookings.
                    {% endif %}
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'overview' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                <!-- ================= PROFILE CARD ================= -->
                <section class="up-reveal up-profile-card">
                    <div class="up-pc-head">

                        <label class="up-photo-picker" for="avatarFileInput" title="Change profile photo">
                            <img
                                id="upAvatarImg"
                                alt="Profile photo"
                                {% if user.avatar %}src="{{ user.avatar }}"{% else %}style="display:none"{% endif %}
                            >
                            <span class="up-photo-fallback" {% if user.avatar %}style="display:none"{% endif %}>
                                <i data-lucide="circle-user-round"></i>
                            </span>
                            <span class="up-photo-badge"><i data-lucide="camera"></i></span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="file" id="avatarFileInput" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" hidden>

                        <div class="up-pc-id">
                            <div class="up-pc-name-row">
                                <h1>{{ user.name }}</h1>
                                {% if id_status == 'verified' %}
                                    <span class="up-badge-id up-badge-id-ok">
                                        <i data-lucide="badge-check"></i> Verified
                                    </span>
                                {% elseif id_status == 'pending' %}
                                    <span class="up-badge-id up-badge-id-wait">
                                        <i data-lucide="clock"></i> Pending review
                                    </span>
                                {% else %}
                                    <span class="up-badge-id up-badge-id-none">
                                        <i data-lucide="shield-alert"></i> Not verified
                                    </span>
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                            <p class="up-pc-sub">
                                RoomHive member{% if user.member_since %} since {{ user.member_since }}{% endif %}
                                {% if is_host %} · Host{% endif %}
                            </p>

                            <ul class="up-meta">
                                {% if user.location %}
                                    <li><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i><span>{{ user.location }}</span></li>
                                {% endif %}
                                {% if user.email %}
                                    <li><i data-lucide="mail"></i><span>{{ user.email }}</span></li>
                                {% endif %}
                                {% if user.phone %}
                                    <li><i data-lucide="phone"></i><span>{{ user.phone }}</span></li>
                                {% endif %}
                                {% if user.member_since %}
                                    <li><i data-lucide="calendar"></i><span>Member since {{ user.member_since }}</span></li>
                                {% endif %}
                            </ul>
                        </div>

                        <div class="up-pc-actions">
                            <a class="up-btn-dark" href="/profile/edit">Edit Profile</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-about">
                        <h3>About Me</h3>
                        <p>No bio yet — tell hosts and travelers a little about yourself.
                            Mention your hometown, your travel style, and what makes a stay great for you.</p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- ================= 4 CHART CARDS ================= -->
                <section class="up-ch-grid">

                    <div class="up-reveal up-ch-card">
                        <header><h3>Bookings</h3><span class="up-ch-sub">last 6 months</span></header>
                        <div class="up-ch-bars">
                            {% for m in chart %}
                                <div class="up-ch-col" title="{{ m.bk }} booking{{ m.bk == 1 ? '' : 's' }} in {{ m.label }}">
                                    <div class="up-ch-barzone">
                                        <div class="up-ch-bar up-ch-bar-bk" style="height: {{ m.bk_h }}%"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="up-ch-lab">{{ m.label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-reveal up-ch-card">
                        <header><h3>Total Spent</h3><span class="up-ch-sub">last 6 months</span></header>
                        <div class="up-ch-bars">
                            {% for m in chart %}
                                <div class="up-ch-col" title="{{ m.sp_str }} spent in {{ m.label }}">
                                    <div class="up-ch-barzone">
                                        <div class="up-ch-bar up-ch-bar-sp" style="height: {{ m.sp_h }}%"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="up-ch-lab">{{ m.label }}</span>
                                </div>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-reveal up-ch-card">
                        <header><h3>Wallet</h3><span class="up-ch-sub">balance vs top-ups</span></header>
                        <div class="up-ch-donut-wrap">
                            <svg class="up-ch-donut" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true">
                                <circle class="donut-bg" cx="24" cy="24" r="20"></circle>
                                <circle class="donut-fg" cx="24" cy="24" r="20" data-pct="{{ wallet.pct }}"></circle>
                            </svg>
                            <div class="up-ch-donut-center">
                                <strong>{{ wallet.balance_short }}</strong>
                                <span>balance</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <dl class="up-ch-donut-legend">
                            <div><dt>Money in</dt><dd>{{ wallet.money_in_str }}</dd></div>
                            <div><dt>Available</dt><dd>{{ wallet.balance_str }}</dd></div>
                        </dl>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-reveal up-ch-card">
                        <header><h3>Wishlist</h3><span class="up-ch-sub" id="upWlCount">{{ wl_total }} saved</span></header>
                        <div class="up-ch-stack">
                            {% for c in wl_categories %}
                                <span
                                    style="width: {{ c.width }}%; background: {{ c.color }};"
                                    title="{{ c.label }} — {{ c.count }}"
                                ></span>
                            {% else %}
                                <span style="width: 100%;"></span>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                        <ul class="up-ch-legend">
                            {% for c in wl_categories %}
                                <li><span class="dot" style="background: {{ c.color }}"></span>{{ c.label }} <b>{{ c.count }}</b></li>
                            {% else %}
                                <li class="muted">Nothing saved yet</li>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                </section>

                <!-- ================= RECENT BOOKINGS + RIGHT COLUMN ================= -->
                <section class="up-two-col">

                    <div class="up-col">
                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head">
                                <h3>Recent Bookings</h3>
                                <a href="/bookings">View all</a>
                            </header>
                            {% for b in bookings %}
                                <article class="up-booking">
                                    <div class="up-booking-photo">
                                        {% if b.cover %}
                                            <img
                                                src="{{ b.cover_url }}"
                                                alt="{{ b.title }}"
                                                onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('noimg'); this.remove();"
                                            >
                                        {% endif %}
                                        <i data-lucide="home"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="up-booking-info">
                                        <h4>{{ b.title }}</h4>
                                        <p class="up-booking-dates"><i data-lucide="calendar"></i>{{ b.dates }}</p>
                                        <span class="up-status up-status-{{ b.status_class }}">{{ b.status_label }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="up-booking-pay">
                                        <strong>{{ b.total_str }}</strong>
                                        <span class="up-paychip up-pay-{{ b.pay_state }}">{{ b.pay_label }}</span>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            {% else %}
                                <p class="up-empty">No bookings yet — <a href="/">find your next stay</a>.</p>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="up-col">

                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head"><h3>Identity Verification</h3></header>
                            {% if id_status == 'verified' %}
                                <p class="up-card-txt">Your government ID is approved. You're fully verified —
                                    hosts see a Verified badge on your profile.</p>
                            {% elseif id_status == 'pending' %}
                                <p class="up-card-txt">We received your ID and it's under review.
                                    This usually takes less than 24 hours.</p>
                            {% else %}
                                <p class="up-card-txt">Verify your identity to build trust with hosts
                                    and unlock faster bookings.</p>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>

                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head">
                                <h3>Payment Summary</h3>
                                <div class="up-sum-tabs">
                                    <button type="button" class="up-sum-tab active" data-tab="week">This week</button>
                                    <button type="button" class="up-sum-tab" data-tab="pending">To pay</button>
                                </div>
                            </header>
                            <div
                                class="up-sum-value"
                                data-week="{{ summary.spent_week_str }}"
                                data-pending="{{ summary.pending_str }}"
                            >{{ summary.spent_week_str }}</div>
                            <p
                                class="up-sum-cap"
                                data-week="spent on bookings in the last 7 days"
                                data-pending="still owed on pending bookings"
                            >spent on bookings in the last 7 days</p>
                            <div class="up-sum-row"><span>Total bookings</span><b>{{ summary.total_bookings }}</b></div>
                            <div class="up-sum-row"><span>All-time spend</span><b>{{ summary.spent_all_str }}</b></div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head"><h3>Payment Methods</h3><a href="/payments">Manage</a></header>
                            <div class="up-pay-method">
                                <i data-lucide="credit-card"></i>
                                <div>
                                    <strong>GCash / Cash on arrival</strong>
                                    <span>arranged per booking</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head"><h3>Account Security</h3></header>
                            <p class="up-card-txt">Manage your password, active sessions and two-factor
                                authentication from <a href="/settings">Settings</a>.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="up-reveal up-card">
                            <header class="up-card-head"><h3>Need Help?</h3></header>
                            <p class="up-card-txt">Answers about bookings, payments and refunds live in the
                                <a href="/help">Help Center</a>.</p>
                        </div>

                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- ================= WISHLIST ================= -->
                <section class="up-reveal up-wl">
                    <header class="up-card-head">
                        <h3>My Wishlist</h3>
                        <a href="/wishlist">View all</a>
                    </header>
                    <div class="up-wl-grid" id="upWishlistGrid">
                        {% for w in wishlist %}
                            <article class="listing-box" data-listing-id="{{ w.id }}">
                                <div class="up-wl-photo">
                                    {% if w.cover %}
                                        <img
                                            src="{{ w.cover_url }}"
                                            alt="{{ w.title }}"
                                            onerror="this.parentElement.classList.add('noimg'); this.remove();"
                                        >
                                    {% endif %}
                                    <i data-lucide="home"></i>
                                    <button type="button" class="up-wl-heart" aria-label="Remove from wishlist">
                                        <i data-lucide="heart"></i>
                                    </button>
                                </div>
                                <div class="up-wl-info">
                                    <h4>{{ w.title }}</h4>
                                    <p class="up-wl-loc"><i data-lucide="map-pin"></i>{{ w.location }}</p>
                                    <p class="up-wl-price"><strong>₱{{ w.price_str }}</strong><span> / night</span></p>
                                </div>
                            </article>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>
                    <p class="up-empty up-wl-empty" id="upWlEmpty" {% if wishlist %}style="display:none"{% endif %}>
                        Nothing saved yet — tap the heart on any listing to save it here.
                    </p>
                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {{ include('partials/footer.html.twig') }}

        <!-- Lucide — guarded loader, same key as navbar (never double-runs) -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";
                function renderRhIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }
                if (!window.__rhNavbarLucide) {
                    window.__rhNavbarLucide = true;
                    var s = document.createElement("script");
                    s.src = "https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.469.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js";
                    s.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
                    document.head.appendChild(s);
                }
                if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", renderRhIcons);
                } else {
                    renderRhIcons();
                }
                window.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Sidebar collapse — same behavior + localStorage key as legacy -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                var sidebar = document.getElementById("upSidebar");
                var toggle = document.getElementById("upSidebarToggle");
                if (!sidebar || !toggle) {
                    return;
                }

                var STORAGE_KEY = "roomhive_sidebar_collapsed";
                var links = sidebar.querySelectorAll(".up-side-link");

                function updateTitles(collapsed) {
                    links.forEach(function (link) {
                        var label = link.querySelector(".up-side-label");
                        if (collapsed) {
                            link.setAttribute("title", label ? label.textContent : "");
                        } else {
                            link.removeAttribute("title");
                        }
                    });
                }

                function applyState(collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.toggle("collapsed", collapsed);
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
                    toggle.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        collapsed ? "Expand sidebar" : "Collapse sidebar",
                    );
                    updateTitles(collapsed);
                }

                var savedCollapsed = false;
                try {
                    savedCollapsed = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === "1";
                } catch (e) {}
                applyState(savedCollapsed);

                toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var nowCollapsed = !sidebar.classList.contains("collapsed");
                    applyState(nowCollapsed);
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, nowCollapsed ? "1" : "0");
                    } catch (e) {}
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Reveal — the REAL legacy mechanism (self-contained):
             .up-reveal waits for .in-view; 1.5s failsafe so the page
             can never render blank -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

                var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(
                    document.querySelectorAll(".up-reveal"),
                );

                function showAll() {
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("in-view");
                    });
                }

                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    showAll();
                } else {
                    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) return;
                                var el = entry.target;
                                io.unobserve(el);
                                el.classList.add("in-view");
                                window.setTimeout(function () {
                                    el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                                }, 1200);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.12,
                            rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
                        },
                    );
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        io.observe(el);
                    });

                    /* failsafe — force-reveal anything still hidden after 1.5s */
                    setTimeout(showAll, 1500);
                }
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Page logic — donut, summary tabs, avatar upload, wishlist remove (1:1) -->
        <script>
            /* Wallet donut — offset = 125.66 × (1 − pct/100) */
            (function () {
                var C = 125.66;
                document.querySelectorAll(".up-ch-donut .donut-fg").forEach(function (c) {
                    var pct = parseFloat(c.getAttribute("data-pct") || "0");
                    if (isNaN(pct)) pct = 0;
                    pct = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, pct));
                    c.style.strokeDashoffset = (C * (1 - pct / 100)).toFixed(2);
                });
            })();

            /* Payment summary tabs — swap value + caption from data attributes */
            (function () {
                var tabs = document.querySelectorAll(".up-sum-tab");
                var val = document.querySelector(".up-sum-value");
                var cap = document.querySelector(".up-sum-cap");
                if (!tabs.length || !val) {
                    return;
                }
                tabs.forEach(function (t) {
                    t.addEventListener("click", function () {
                        tabs.forEach(function (x) {
                            x.classList.remove("active");
                        });
                        t.classList.add("active");
                        var k = t.getAttribute("data-tab");
                        if (val.getAttribute("data-" + k)) {
                            val.textContent = val.getAttribute("data-" + k);
                        }
                        if (cap && cap.getAttribute("data-" + k)) {
                            cap.textContent = cap.getAttribute("data-" + k);
                        }
                    });
                });
            })();

            /* Avatar upload — POST /profile/avatar, sync page + navbar */
            (function () {
                var input = document.getElementById("avatarFileInput");
                if (!input) {
                    return;
                }
                input.addEventListener("change", function () {
                    var f = input.files && input.files[0];
                    if (!f) {
                        return;
                    }
                    var fd = new FormData();
                    fd.append("avatar", f);
                    fetch("/profile/avatar", { method: "POST", body: fd })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json();
                        })
                        .then(function (d) {
                            if (!d || !d.ok) {
                                alert((d && d.error) || "Upload failed");
                                return;
                            }
                            var url =
                                d.url +
                                (d.url.indexOf("?") > -1 ? "&" : "?") +
                                "t=" +
                                Date.now();
                            var img = document.getElementById("upAvatarImg");
                            if (img) {
                                img.src = url;
                                img.style.display = "";
                            }
                            var fb = document.querySelector(".up-photo-fallback");
                            if (fb) {
                                fb.style.display = "none";
                            }
                            var navImg = document.getElementById("navAccountAvatarImg");
                            if (navImg) {
                                navImg.src = url;
                            }
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            alert("Upload failed — check your connection.");
                        });
                });
            })();

            /* Wishlist remove — capture-phase delegation, POST /wishlist/remove */
            document.addEventListener(
                "click",
                function (ev) {
                    var t = ev.target;
                    if (!(t instanceof Element)) {
                        return;
                    }
                    var heart = t.closest(".up-wl-heart");
                    if (!heart) {
                        return;
                    }
                    ev.preventDefault();
                    ev.stopPropagation();
                    var box = heart.closest(".listing-box");
                    var id = box ? box.getAttribute("data-listing-id") : null;
                    if (!id) {
                        return;
                    }
                    heart.classList.add("busy");
                    fetch("/wishlist/remove", {
                        method: "POST",
                        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" },
                        body: "listing_id=" + encodeURIComponent(id),
                    })
                        .then(function (r) {
                            return r.json();
                        })
                        .then(function (d) {
                            if (d && d.ok) {
                                if (box) {
                                    box.remove();
                                }
                                var cnt = document.getElementById("upWlCount");
                                if (cnt) {
                                    var n = parseInt(cnt.textContent, 10);
                                    if (!isNaN(n) && n > 0) {
                                        cnt.textContent = n - 1 + " saved";
                                    }
                                }
                                var grid = document.getElementById("upWishlistGrid");
                                if (grid && !grid.querySelector(".listing-box")) {
                                    var empty = document.getElementById("upWlEmpty");
                                    if (empty) {
                                        empty.style.display = "";
                                    }
                                }
                            } else {
                                heart.classList.remove("busy");
                                alert((d && d.error) || "Could not remove this listing.");
                            }
                        })
                        .catch(function () {
                            heart.classList.remove("busy");
                            alert("Network error — try again.");
                        });
                },
                true,
            );
        </script>

    </body>

</html>
